WEBVTT

00:07:29.288 --> 00:07:30.663
Controlling the narrative,

00:07:31.163 --> 00:07:33.454
this is a key strategy for
being proactive in

00:07:33.454 --> 00:07:34.829
the face of career turbulence,

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:39.246
crafting a story about how a headwind
has made you stronger or better.

00:07:40.413 --> 00:07:42.496
Research demonstrates that
in the job search,

00:07:42.788 --> 00:07:46.496
sex offenders are better off owning their
mistakes than making excuses.

00:07:46.954 --> 00:07:49.579
Your headwinds may be lighter
than time behind bars.

00:07:50.246 --> 00:07:52.246
Maybe you lost a job that was a bad fit,

00:07:52.538 --> 00:07:55.746
or you took time off to care for a
child or a sick family member.

00:07:56.288 --> 00:07:57.496
Or maybe you have a physical

00:07:57.496 --> 00:08:01.496
or psychological disability that
prospective employers wrongly judge.